## 📦 Installation

Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ayushk2612/PixelCalc.git
```

Navigate to the project

```bash
cd PixelCalc
```

Install dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

---

## ▶️ Run Locally

Start the development server

```bash
npm start
```

Open your browser and visit

```text
http://localhost:3000
```

---

## 🏗️ Build for Production

```bash
npm run build
```

---

## 🚀 Deploy to GitHub Pages

```bash
npm run deploy
```

